        "summary": "In Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back the player takes on the role of a Rebel pilot attempting to destroy AT-ATs on Hoth.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pix.jpg",
