        "name": "Worm War I",
        "summary": "Your mission, as a master tank commander, is to drive through the city of Teriyaki and blast away as many Worms and Blocks as possible without running out of fuel.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/inafnktzqyabhwv3fn5m.jpg",
