        "cached_at": 1772527938
      },
      {
        "id": 24495,
        "name": "Mangia'",
        "summary": "Your mother has been cooking all day preparing your favorite pasta dish, but then nothing is too good for her favorite! Now, it's only fair that you put a smile on her face, a gleam in her eyes, and a glow in her heart. How? How else! Eat! Eat! - Mangia! Mangia! Come on, it's good for you!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xkkwg7pm0y4xdnquvsla.jpg",
