      },
      {
        "id": 24828,
        "name": "Targ",
        "summary": "Targ is a one or two player shooter game released by Exidy in 1980.\n\nYour town is invaded by Targ riders, you must manouvre the heroic vehicle Whummel to destroy them. From time to time, a Spectar comes into screen, and can be destroyed for extra bonus.\n\nAction takes place into a 9x9 grid, \"Crystal City\", where the player's vehicle must avoid and chase down 10 enemy wedge-shaped vehicles. When all enemies are destroyed, you are awarded an extra bonus and can access the following level. Two players can alternate in the game. You use a 4 way joystick to control the Whummel, and a pushbutton to fire at enemies. Progressing in the gameplay causes the Targs to become faster and smarter, for a fast and furious gameplay.\n\nA small trivia on the game and characters name: apparently, Targ stands for Target, Spectar stands for Special Target.\n\nThis game has a sequel, always released in 1980, Spectar.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6uca.jpg",
        "release_date": 347068800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Shooter|Racing|Arcade",
        "platform_ids": "52,59",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/targ",
        "cached_at": 1772527938
      },
      {
        "id": 25727,
        "name": "Roc 'N Rope",
        "summary": "Your player is a mountain climber who must avoid cavemen, dinosaurs and pterodactyls as he climbs up the cliff-sides. Your goal in each level is to climb up and reach a mystical bird with great plumage, while staying one step above the bonus timer which determines how long you may stay on each level.\n\nThe mountain climber has only one ability; to shoot rope at 45 degree angles which he may then climb up to other platforms. His other action is a stun beam which will allow him to walk past enemies who get too close; but will only work horizontally from him. As for power-ups, on each level is (usually 2) a flashing diamond power-up which will make him invincible and allow him to defeat monsters. Also as a power-up are glowing treasures of some kind which are worth extra points.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co301m.jpg",
        "release_date": 441676800,
        "rating": null,
