      },
      {
        "id": 40621,
        "name": "Spiderdroid",
        "summary": "It's the future, when droids do battle. You send your Spiderdroid in to capture a building by covering the structure with its unbreakable Droidweb. Your Spiderdroid lays down a web strand as it crawls along each girder. Once you have strung a web strand completely around an opening, the Spiderdroid flings a web over that opening. Your objective is to travel all the building's girders so the entire structure is caught in\nyour Droidweb.\n\nBut watch out! The building is swarming with Birddroids out to have your Spiderdroid for lunch. If you get cornered, use your secret weapon!\n\nPress the Joystick's button to cast a magic spell that makes the Birddroids\ninvisible and unable to eat you...but only for a few seconds. And remember - each of your Spiderdroids can cast only four magic spells.\n\nOnce you capture the first building, it's time to send your advanced\nMummydroid to capture the next one, which is guarded by a horde of Skeledroids!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ymj.jpg",
        "release_date": 539136000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "59",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/spiderdroid",
        "cached_at": 1772527938
      },
      {
        "id": 40622,
        "name": "Coconuts",
        "summary": "In CocoNuts Stanley the intrepid jungle explorer is under attack from Coco the monkey! Coco is up in the trees throwing coconuts at Stanley. You control Stanley and need to dodge the incoming coconuts. You begin the game equipped with a helmet and an umbrella to protect yourself. Each time you are hit by a coconut, you lose one of these items. You may also regain an item by scoring enough points. The game ends when you have nothing left to protect yourself and a coconut hits you. Of course, the longer you can last in the game, the faster it becomes!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ihv.jpg",
        "release_date": 402537600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Arcade",
        "platform_ids": "59",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/coconuts",
        "cached_at": 1772527938
      },
      {
        "id": 40623,
        "name": "Pete Rose Baseball",
        "summary": "Here's the first 2600 Baseball game to live up to this winning attitude. \n \n* From the crack of the bat, make split second decisions as you choose which \n fielder makes the play. \n* Throw popular Major League pitches - fast balls, curves, change-ups, \n screwballs and sinkers. (Spitballs?) \n* Head to head action with your friends or against the computer. \n* Complete TV-like coverage, with six camera angles you're always right there \n where the action is. \n* Play to a packed stadium complete with cheering crowd and organist. (Bring \n your own peanuts and hotdogs.) \n* The most exciting baseball ever on the 2600 with depth and feel you've \n seen on Big League Home Computers.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1kon.jpg",
        "release_date": 570672000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Sport",
        "platform_ids": "59",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pete-rose-baseball",
        "cached_at": 1772527938
      },
      {
        "id": 40624,
        "name": "Skate Boardin'",
        "summary": "You know you're late for school, but what you don't_ know is that just overnight, an array of obstacles has been placed along the way. Radical man, this is a skateboarder's dream come true! You have to get to school on time, but passing up the chance to ride ramps or cruise tubes would make you look like a real nerd! You've got to conquer a total of thirty tubes and ramps in under five minutes to be totally awesome. Not only that, after you find all the tubes and ramps you have to find the front steps of the school building. Check the ratings at the end of the instructions to find out how radical you are.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ymk.jpg",
        "release_date": 539136000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Sport|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "59",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/skate-boardin",
        "cached_at": 1772527938
      },
      {
        "id": 40625,
        "name": "Trick Shot",
        "summary": "Trick Shot is a pool game for one or two players. You can choose to play pool (first player to 25 points wins), billiards (first player to 50 points wins), trickshot (attempt to earn points by sinking all of the balls on the table in a single shot), or trickshot practice game variations. During the game you use the joystick to control a cursor which aims the cue ball. By holding down the button you control the amount of power in a shot (the longer you hold down the button, the more power the cue ball is hit with). You may also apply some English by moving the joystick while hitting the cue ball. At the end of the game a trophy will appear on screen to indicate who the winner is!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/qqios8encib3zxkbjewp.jpg",
        "release_date": 381369600,
