      {
        "id": 40664,
        "name": "3-D Havoc",
        "summary": "Your stellar cruiser begins to shudder as the hyperwarp drive suddenly cuts out. Slowing down, you realize you've entered an asteroids field. A BIG asteroid field. You bolt for the high-density laser-pulse inverter. Your only chance is to blast your way out. And you better start now...\n\nOriginally planned for December 1983 release on cancelled \"Power Play Arcade\" 3-in-1 cartridge. Eventually released as limited edition standalone cartridge under the Video Soft label in 2010.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6gfc.jpg",
