        "summary": "Help! You are on a magical rescue mission. Your task? Help Mickey stop an army of brooms from flooding the Sorcerer's cavern with water. How? Stop the brooms, and stop the stars from creating more brooms. Turn meteors into empty buckets to bail out water. Where? Meet Mickey in the mountains. When? Immediately!",
