      {
        "id": 40697,
        "name": "Save Our Ship",
        "summary": "You're the captain of a capital ship, sailing the Spanish Main. Suddenly you're attacked by hordes of ruthless, cut-throat Pirates. Dozens of them swarm aboard and only you, with your trusty cutlass, can Save Our Ship! You have to out-think, out maneuver and out-fight them all. Otherwise you're sunk!",
