      {
        "id": 40753,
        "name": "Space Instegators",
        "summary": "Space Instigators is a version of the popular arcade game Space Invaders that is more faithful to the original than Atari's 2600 port. This version fits nine invaders in a row without flicker, an impressive feat on the Atari 2600. The graphics, colors and sounds are truer to the original version than Atari's effort.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/tptc9yglyvvea2wqu993.jpg",
