      {
        "id": 40776,
        "name": "Okie Dokie",
        "summary": "Okie Dokie was the first original homebrew game written for the Atari 2600 by Bob Colbert. Okie Dokie is a fast moving puzzle game that challenges you with 30 preset puzzles and 435 random puzzles. It seems simple enough, turn off all of the squares. Well, there's a catch! Every time you select a square, it gets \"flipped\" -- if it was on it turns off and visa versa. To complicate things further, any square directly to the left, right, above, or below the square is also \"flipped.\"",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ymu.jpg",
