        "summary": "The fourth and final game in the SwordQuest series. Ever since the glorious history of this franchise with it's comics, merchandise, and competitions, the story sadly never got it's conclusion back then with the 3rd entry: Waterworld, being considered the last... until now! The Atari and Digital Eclipse Heavens have opened up to finally allow us to experience the 4th and Final Entry!\nAscend into the the heavens in Swordquest: AirWorld!\nThe game finally release 2022 as part of the Atari 50: The Anniversary Celebration.",
