      {
        "id": 321654,
        "name": "Razor's Edge",
        "summary": "Sarah Stone, a renowned reporter and expert fighter, decides to rescue her sister kidnapped by a gang of criminals that have taken over the city. On her journey she will encounter several enemies ready to stop her from completing the mission.\nSarah knows the dangers, her life is on a razor's edge...",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9fbp.jpg",
