        "summary": "Terror reigns in The Old Kingdom. An evil sorcerer is ruling the land. Then one day, he is challenged by a barbarian Knight who is traveling from a foreign land to seek fame and fortune. You take control of the brave knight as you decide the fate of the Kingdom in this all-new Atari 2600 game.\n\nFight your way through the forest and conquer the three castles he occupies to overthrow the evil sorcerer and become the new king.",
